  "implementation": [
    "Core shape validation and current shape resolution share a thin inlinable leaf evaluator for exact Constant and Parameter expressions. Constants keep all64 bits; parameters read the current slice with the original checked unknown-ID error.",
    "The complete original compound evaluator remains. Add/multiply/min/max and holes keep their checked arithmetic, left-to-right recursion, empty-operator errors and original error precedence. Recursive children use the same current leaf evaluator; no source reassociation or mathematical shortcuts are added.",
    "The shared Core path serves resident/JIT numeric kernels, shape instantiation, matrix access and compiler dimension checks. It retains no evaluated dimensions, source Values, pointers, ownership, permits or schema-validity authority.",
    "IR378/work147 identify the changed execution path. ABI42, complete shape/source/construction prices, resource admission and both established exact Huffman work equations remain unchanged. Benchmark sources, inputs, pinned C binaries, tolerances and timing boundaries are unchanged."
